---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---
<BaseLayout title="About"><section class="border-b border-[var(--line)] bg-[#eaf5eb]"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] lg:items-end"><div><p class="mono mb-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--coral)]">Hello, I’m Maria</p><h1 class="text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[.9] tracking-[-.08em] sm:text-8xl">I make things for curious people<span class="text-[var(--coral)]">.</span></h1></div><div><div class="mb-6 aspect-square max-w-[260px] overflow-hidden border-8 border-white bg-[#b9e8d3]"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Portrait of Maria Feofanova" class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale"/></div><p class="text-lg text-[var(--muted)]">Designer, developer, and persistent question-asker. I work where clear thinking meets a little bit of wonder.</p><div class="mt-6 flex gap-5 text-sm font-bold"><a href="https://github.com/mfeofanova">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr]"><p class="mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--coral)]">Currently</p><div><h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-[-.05em]">Making the internet feel a little more human.</h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-[var(--muted)]">I care about tools that respect attention, interfaces that invite exploration, and code that stays understandable six months later.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
